{"id": "Dc8fKPEgN92", "title": "Video by jackroberts___", "description": "Comment \"AGENCY\" and I'll send you the link.\n\nOne assistant can't run a company.\n\nYou've been asking it to anyway.\n\nSame chat. Same context. Every job.\n\nLegal question, then a landing page.\n\nIt does both badly.\n\nagency-agents takes the opposite approach.\n\n280 specialists in one folder.\n\nEngineers. Designers. Marketers. Salespeople.\n\nThere are even lawyers in there.\n\nEach one has its own way of working.\n\nIts own tools and capabilities.\n\nSo it isn't one assistant wearing hats.\n\nOne install drops all 280 on your laptop.\n\nLike staffing a whole agency in an afternoon.\n\nEveryone already knows their job.\n\nYou stop prompting harder.\n\nYou start delegating properly.\n\nThe whole thing is free on GitHub.\n\n#agencyagents #aiagents #claudecode #github #automation", "channel": "jackroberts___", "uploader_id": "66393143335", "uploader": "Jack Roberts", "timestamp": 1788696061, "like_count": 2458, "comment_count": 4473, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-17957952048215336a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 64.635, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.flis9-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPS32zsOuvpqisDdfagNwEOp9J-2szqo1SOVfVpKg8TSepH7XfWSZoyFGwtlx-9LW3rCFLluOFG3tl0qndXuWQcidwNvzCJ9HA-cRc.mp4?_nc_cat=104&_nc_oc=AdrTuAdOufNQM70K9WSVEM37QyrxY054SozhFQ2zkB-tC_WKxuhotA_pXmdBVT0R13w&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.flis9-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=Y0M_byU5H9wQ7kNvwENxOoT&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=u377YuMcp4gY7TwNFZeGhw&_nc_zt=28&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQKgi6hL8QZGCKOmounxQ4hrejeh